### Masked profile - what the browser receives
GET http://localhost:5219/api/v1/members/me

### Unmasked - privileged role (writes an audit line to the API console)
GET http://localhost:5219/api/v1/members/me
X-Demo-Role: officer

### DEMO ONLY - the "before" payload, straight off the entity
GET http://localhost:5219/api/v1/members/me/unmasked-demo

### CSV export - masked via Mask.Apply, not the JSON serialiser
GET http://localhost:5219/api/v1/members/me/export

### Safe write - no NRIC in the request DTO at all
PUT http://localhost:5219/api/v1/members/me/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.email@example.com",
  "mobileNumber": "98887777",
  "mailingAddress": "Blk 456 Bishan St 22, #11-03, Singapore 570456"
}

### Round-trip a masked NRIC - expect HTTP 400 from RejectMaskedValuesFilter
PUT http://localhost:5219/api/v1/members/me/profile-unsafe-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nric": "S****567D",
  "email": "weiming.tan@example.com",
  "mobileNumber": "91234567",
  "mailingAddress": "Blk 123 Ang Mo Kio Ave 6"
}
